# ── E-OPEN-SOURCE-001 / S-OS-04 leak enforcers (ED-417) ──
# Private product trees + origin-product specs removed from the INDEX only (files stay on
# disk; the private mirror holds history). Enforcer: scripts/checks/framework-purity.js
# (full-tree, fail-closed on the private slugs) + scripts/checks/leak-denylist.js.
_mc/EXAMPLES/
_docs/research/*-staffing-layer/
_mc/BASELINE/_docs/research/*-staffing-layer/
_docs/research/2026-05-21-product-clone-*-postmortem.md
_mc/BASELINE/_docs/research/2026-05-21-product-clone-*-postmortem.md
scripts/delta-*.txt
scripts/write-mr-fix1-brief.js
